{"id":6102,"chapter_id":6,"scene_id":612,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"梦魇撞开了顶楼大门，你们冲出封闭的高塔，到达离天空最近的地方。","style":3,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"在赤色光环之下，跪坐着一个庞大的身体，聚拢双翼，像在沉思，或等待谁的光临。","style":3,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"海拉","content":"那是卓娅……还是厄尔希？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6102003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":508,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"是环的主人——受骸者。","voice":["vo_cgplot_6102004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":508,"log_type":1}]}